    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vibrant world of jigsaw puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together high-quality photographic images featuring countries, animals, technology and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a selection of free puzzles, expanding your collection with DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your game with jigsaw size and piece shape options. The puzzles can be as challenging as you decide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive puzzle experience, with a clean interface and relaxing soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jigsaw puzzles to earn Steam achievements and unlock hidden bonus puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Begin your puzzle world adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vibrant world of jigsaw puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together high-quality photographic images featuring countries, animals, technology and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a selection of free puzzles, expanding your collection with DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your game with jigsaw size and piece shape options. The puzzles can be as challenging as you decide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive puzzle experience, with a clean interface and relaxing soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete jigsaw puzzles to earn Steam achievements and unlock hidden bonus puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Begin your puzzle world adventure!</p>",
    "short_description": "A selection of photographic jigsaw puzzles. Customize your puzzle experience and expand the game with DLC.",
